  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, some of my moderators do not have a mic, which makes it difficult for them to properly moderate in group public instances. I would like VRChat to add an optional \"Reason\" tab when warning, kicking, or banning a user. This would allow moderators to type a reason for their action, improving clarity and communication.\n\nAdditionally, I suggest preventing lower group roles (such as Admins) from being able to warn, kick, or ban the group owner to avoid misuse.\n\nThis would help ensure better moderation and avoid confusion in group-managed instances.",
